          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ EXPERIENCE ═══════════ -->
    <section class="sec" id="experience">
      <aside class="note" aria-hidden="true"><span>Service record</span></aside>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <ol class="xp">
          <li>
            <span class="dates">08/2025 – present</span>
            <h3>Software Developer · DaunPenh Data Center</h3>
            <p>Production apps and internal services: an offline-first sales-force platform, reporting APIs, and data systems.</p>
            <p class="tech">Next.js · Laravel · Go · PostgreSQL · MongoDB · Redis · Docker</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="dates">02/2025 – 08/2025</span>
            <h3>Web Developer · QL Management Company</h3>
            <p>Full-stack web features with product and QA; performance and UX improvements.</p>
            <p class="tech">Laravel · Vue · MySQL</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="dates">2024</span>
            <h3>Intern · National Polytechnic Institute of Cambodia</h3>
            <p>Web development fundamentals and team workflows; first production Laravel + Vue features.</p>
            <p class="tech">Laravel · Vue · MySQL</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ WORK / PLATES ═══════════ -->
    <section class="sec" id="work">
      <aside class="note" aria-hidden="true"><span>Plate set 01–02</span></aside>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Work</h2>

        <article class="plate">
          <div class="plate-head">
            <span class="pno">Plate 01</span>
            <span class="ptitle">Provida SFA: offline-first sales platform</span>
            <span class="pdate">2025</span>
          </div>
          <div class="plate-body">
            <p>
              Sales reps in the field order without signal. Orders queue on-device with idempotency
              keys and sync safely when the network returns, with no duplicates and no lost work. The app
              tracks customer visits and stock counts, and closes the day with reports: sales
              history with order-status breakdowns, end-of-day summaries, and activity maps.
            </p>
            <p class="tech">Next.js (PWA) · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS · IndexedDB sync queue</p>
            <pre class="code"><code>// Stable idempotency key survives queueing + retries → no duplicate orders
await addToSyncQueue('createMobileSaleOrder', ensureClientRequestId(order));</code></pre>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="plate">
          <div class="plate-head">
            <span class="pno">Plate 02</span>
            <span class="ptitle">Provida Report Platform: Laravel order backend</span>
            <span class="pdate">2025</span>
          </div>
          <div class="plate-body">
            <p>
              The API behind the SFA app: order approval workflow with Sage ERP sync, per-customer
              sales dashboards, and mobile endpoints scoped by sales rep, on MySQL with
              JSON-scoped territories.
            </p>
            <p class="tech">Laravel · MySQL · Vue 3 · Redis</p>
            <pre class="code"><code>-- Per-customer order status counts, from the sale-dashboard API
SUM(CASE WHEN o.OrderStatusId = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS orders_pending</code></pre>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ EDUCATION & CERTIFICATIONS ═══════════ -->
    <section class="sec" id="education">
      <aside class="note" aria-hidden="true"><span>Credentials</span></aside>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <ol class="xp">
          <li>
            <span class="dates">01–02/2024</span>
            <h3>Nanyang Polytechnic International, Singapore</h3>
            <p>ASEAN and Republic of Korea TVET Mobility Program, IT Applications & Development.</p>
            <span class="stamp">Certified</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="dates">12/2024</span>
            <h3>Guangzhou Industry and Trade Technician College</h3>
            <p>ILO and China South-South Cooperation: Internet of Things online training. Cert № GZITTC-IN20240055.</p>
            <span class="stamp">Completed</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="dates">2024</span>
            <h3>National Polytechnic Institute of Cambodia</h3>
            <p>Internship: practical web development and team collaboration.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ CONTACT ═══════════ -->
    <section class="sec" id="contact">
      <aside class="note" aria-hidden="true"><span>Available</span></aside>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p class="statement">The fastest way to reach me is email or Telegram.</p>
        <ul class="contact">
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"/></svg>
            <a href="mailto:hongraksa097@gmail.com">hongraksa097@gmail.com</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 2 11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <a href="https://t.me/ReaksaNamikaze" rel="me noopener">Telegram: @ReaksaNamikaze</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0 5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5ZM3 9h4v12H3zM9 9h3.8v1.7h.05c.53-1 1.83-2.05 3.77-2.05 4.03 0 4.78 2.65 4.78 6.1V21h-4v-5.5c0-1.31-.02-3-1.83-3-1.83 0-2.11 1.43-2.11 2.9V21H9z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hoeng-reaksa-48b5842b3" rel="me noopener">LinkedIn: hoeng-reaksa</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.56 0-.28-.01-1.02-.02-2-3.2.7-3.88-1.54-3.88-1.54-.52-1.33-1.28-1.68-1.28-1.68-1.05-.72.08-.71.08-.71 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.23-1.28-5.23-5.68 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.19-3.09-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.18 1.18a11.1 11.1 0 0 1 5.8 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.83 1.19 3.09 0 4.41-2.69 5.38-5.25 5.66.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14 0 1.55-.01 2.79-.01 3.17 0 .31.21.68.8.56A11.52 11.52 0 0 0 23.5 12C23.5 5.65 18.35.5 12 .5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            <a href="https://github.com/Poseidon9991" rel="me noopener">GitHub: Poseidon9991</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="sheet-end">
    <div>
      <span><b>Drawn by</b>Hoeng Reaksa</span>
      <span><b>Scale</b>1:1</span>
      <span><b>Rev</b>2026.09</span>
      <span><b>Sheet</b>1 of 1</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --paper: #F3F5EF;
      --ink: #1B231E;
      --graphite: #57625B;
      --rule: rgba(27, 35, 30, .16);
      --grid-major: rgba(27, 35, 30, .055);
      --grid-minor: rgba(27, 35, 30, .028);
      --instrument: #146B45;
      --instrument-deep: #0E5336;
      --red-pencil: #C23A26;
      --paper-deep: #EBEEE5;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 84px;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Kantumruy Pro', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--ink);
      background-color: var(--paper);
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(var(--grid-major) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-major) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(var(--grid-minor) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-minor) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 64px 64px, 64px 64px, 8px 8px, 8px 8px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    ::selection { background: var(--instrument); color: var(--paper); }

    h1, h2, h3, .grp, .btn, .stamp, .tb-head, .plate-head, .note {
      font-family: 'Archivo Variable', 'Kantumruy Pro', sans-serif;
    }

    a { color: var(--instrument); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    a:hover { color: var(--instrument-deep); }

    :focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--instrument);
      outline-offset: 3px;
      border-radius: 1px;
    }

    .skip {
      position: fixed;
      top: -48px;
      left: 16px;
      z-index: 10;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
      padding: 10px 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: top .15s ease-out;
    }
    .skip:focus { top: 12px; }

    /* ── Topbar ─────────────────────────────── */
    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 5;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px);
      height: 60px;
      background: rgba(243, 245, 239, .92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .mark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
      text-decoration: none;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .topbar nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 4px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .topbar nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .topbar nav a {
      color: var(--graphite);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    }
    .topbar nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--instrument); }
    .locale {
      color: var(--graphite);
      font-size: 13px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding-left: 8px;
    }

    /* ── Page grid & margin rule ───────────── */
    .page {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 1060px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: clamp(40px, 7vw, 88px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 40px;
    }
    .sec {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 28px 0;
    }
    .sec + .sec { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .note {
      display: none;
      color: var(--red-pencil);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .note span { display: block; }
    .note span + span { margin-top: 2px; }

    @media (min-width: 920px) {
      .sec { grid-template-columns: 148px 1fr; column-gap: 56px; }
      .note {
        display: block;
        text-align: right;
        padding-top: 7px;
      }
      .page::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 172px;
        width: 1px;
        background: var(--red-pencil);
        opacity: .5;
      }
    }

    .body { max-width: 720px; }
    .body > p { max-width: 66ch; }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.75rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    /* ── Hero title block ───────────────────── */
    .hero { padding-top: 8px; }
    .tb {
      border: 1px solid rgba(27, 35, 30, .3);
      padding: 5px;
      max-width: 780px;
      animation: wipe .55s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .tb-inner {
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
    }
    .tb-head {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px 32px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--graphite);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .tb-head b {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -.025em;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      text-wrap: balance;
      animation: settle .6s .18s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .khmer {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--graphite);
      animation: settle .6s .26s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .role {
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      letter-spacing: .01em;
      animation: settle .6s .32s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .statement {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 46ch;
      animation: settle .6s .4s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .tb-fields {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px 24px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      animation: settle .6s .48s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .tb-fields b {
      display: block;
      font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--graphite);
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .tb-fields span { font-size: 15px; }
    .cta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      animation: settle .6s .56s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1) both;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 11px 22px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color .14s ease-out, color .14s ease-out, border-color .14s ease-out;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
    .btn.primary { background: var(--instrument); border-color: var(--instrument); color: var(--paper); }
    .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--instrument-deep); border-color: var(--instrument-deep); }

    @keyframes wipe { from { clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0); } to { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); } }
    @keyframes settle {
      from { opacity: 0; filter: blur(5px); transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; filter: blur(0); transform: none; }
    }

    /* ── Stack rows ─────────────────────────── */
    .srow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .srow:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .grp {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--graphite);
    }
    .srow p { margin: 0; max-width: 60ch; }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .srow { grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: baseline; }
    }

    /* ── Experience / education rows ────────── */
    .xp { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .xp li { padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .xp li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .dates {
      font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
      color: var(--graphite);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .xp h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
      margin: 6px 0 8px;
    }
    .xp p { margin: 0 0 6px; max-width: 62ch; }
    .tech { color: var(--graphite); font-size: 14px; }
    .stamp {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--instrument);
      color: var(--instrument);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
      border-radius: 2px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(100% 100% at 30% 20%, #000 92%, transparent 96%);
    }

    /* ── Plates ─────────────────────────────── */
    .plate {
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
    .plate:first-of-type { margin-top: 4px; }
    .plate-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--paper-deep);
      padding: 10px 18px;
    }
    .plate-head .pno {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--instrument);
    }
    .plate-head .ptitle { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
    .plate-head .pdate {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--graphite);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .plate-head { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: baseline; }
    }
    .plate-body { padding: 18px; }
    .plate-body p { max-width: 64ch; margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .code {
      margin: 14px 0 4px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: var(--paper-deep);
      border: 1px solid rgba(27, 35, 30, .22);
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-family: 'Spline Sans Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .code code { font: inherit; }

    /* ── Contact ────────────────────────────── */
    .contact { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; }
    .contact li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .contact li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .contact svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      color: var(--ink);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .contact a { font-weight: 500; }

    /* ── Footer sheet corner ────────────────── */
    .sheet-end { padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 48px; }
    .sheet-end > div {
      max-width: 1060px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px 36px;
      border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      padding-top: 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--graphite);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .sheet-end b {
      font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-right: 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
